{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a romance simulation.<br>Here, you won\u2019t find clich\u00e9, naive heroines\u2014only your genuine charm and flirting skills can win a girl\u2019s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are your romantic experiences few and far between?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you find yourself stressed over relationships?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you wasted money on overpriced \u2018dating guides\u2019?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes, all you lack is the right experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While this game won\u2019t spoon-feed you all the answers, playing to the end will sharpen your real-world dating instincts\u2014potentially saving you time and boosting your success rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple save slots and branching endings await.<br>A unique blend of puzzles and combat, with mouse-driven click-and-drag mechanics.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625600?t=1744510165","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625600?t=1744510165","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625600/6aa5311c2f9ddfcf39c6e87a599061116ff62826/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744510165","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625600/6aa5311c2f9ddfcf39c6e87a599061116ff62826/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744510165","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a romance simulation.<br>Here, you won\u2019t find clich\u00e9, naive heroines\u2014only your